{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "091164954cec3511dcd58b7191c60f434361a1531a96849dca0bc248a64212e5", "ja": "（今日はビーチで新曲のPV撮影！\n天候にも恵まれて、準備は着々と進んでいる）", "zh": "（今天要在海滩拍摄新歌的PV！天气也很给力，准备工作正在顺利进行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "28dc6e0fad724ca19779345814bc307b22614e45c3e5608aa3648c0632398054", "ja": "あ、{$P$}くん、お疲れさま♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "82b505717985e6dbad3af07e4e972e6c138780b11af155f1f9f887ff2fb977ae", "ja": "莉緒、お疲れ様。\n今回の衣装も、よく似合ってるよ！", "zh": "莉绪，辛苦了。这次的服装也很适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "8d6490876fc5fec68960f1c11cc5a433c3777272b8ef17d86866783d97530133", "ja": "ウフフ、ありがと♪　私も気に入ってるの。\nトロピカルで、かわいいわよね。", "zh": "嘻嘻，谢谢♪我也很喜欢这套。\n很有热带风情，很可爱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "7b75bce607caaf2b56f7ff62857cc8899cd97649c5216578b429a4f1b07a7e4b", "ja": "海を見ると思い出すわ……二泊三日の合宿。\nすっごく楽しかったわよね！", "zh": "看到大海就会想起来……两晚三天的集训。\n真的特别开心，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1248f45c5e9ad9d32b38df146d2aed31e6cbb1d55768bd4c35509afacbb59ae1", "ja": "そうだな。海に向かって叫んだり、失恋のイメトレを\nしたり……あれも今思えば、いい特訓だったのかもな。", "zh": "是啊。对着大海呐喊，做失恋的情景训练……现在想想，那也算是很好的特训了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "c971900c33c386b7dac32b98bd026a259d4e785f60c5dc20b1fe1216f7d78472", "ja": "今思えばって、何よ～。あの特訓がなかったら、\nふたりはハジけられなかったかもしれないでしょ？", "zh": "现在才说“回想起来”～，这算什么嘛。要是没有那次特训，说不定我们俩都没法尽情释放自己呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "a5b47c7e71e9646415043da44e5528642ad858f66fb611a6e1dfe95f8e313907", "ja": "まあ、私が勘違いさせちゃったのかもしれないけど……\n結果的に、みんなで前に進めたからいいじゃない♪", "zh": "不过，或许也是我让你们误会了就是了……\n但结果大家都一起前进了，不也挺好的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c12006a84ea4e4479a9e0e25a422d4ea532500abea79cf50ac416468f7c8420b", "ja": "確かに、あの時の莉緒は頼もしかったな。\nありがとう！", "zh": "确实，那时候的莉緒很可靠呢。\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "78a56f0771c5400c29a5aeab4b595a05fdf4c9a6ebef41dba7a5196a56a8e60c", "ja": "あら、私は当たり前のことを言っただけよ？\n失恋して、落ち込まない女の子なんていないもの。", "zh": "哎呀，我只是说了理所当然的话而已啦。\n毕竟哪有女孩子失恋了会不消沉的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "c25abd193f88a1c91abc84ddf436664db858bbd488457675e7c85e2c50147bb4", "ja": "ううん、女の子だけじゃないわね。男の子も……\n好きな人だったら、誰だって落ち込むと思うわ。", "zh": "不对，不仅是女孩子呢。男孩子也一样……\n只要是喜欢的人，我想任谁都会消沉的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1f8aa0d110de836c50686b7767e7778f37e32133ee8df4c49586fb09808829a6", "ja": "そうだよな……莉緒も、失恋をして\n落ち込んだことがあるのか？", "zh": "对啊……莉绪也曾经失恋，难过过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "ecfa15bc1c0c1293c7ca5d1be97df5ca9b6c57caa74e9082714d9ad6c1f1b2cc", "ja": "えっ、わ、私！？　そうねぇ……\nまあ、失恋ってほどじゃないけど……。", "zh": "诶，我、我吗！？这个嘛……\n唔，倒也没到失恋的程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "cc5dc5ce53bf3ced8d6e56d7786250128f965a5fe44df5835449fc137e0e9e6f", "ja": "アピールしても全然気づいてもらえなくて、\nそれで落ち込んだことならある……かしら？", "zh": "就算主动示好，也完全没能让对方察觉到，因此消沉过……算是有过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d4102a57ba9ec6265101956b54c5012fed222ef927747ffca6498765ef208c34", "ja": "そうか。それはがっかりするな。\nもしかしたら、アピールがわかりにくいのかもな。", "zh": "这样啊。那确实会让人失望。\n说不定，是你的表现不太容易让人注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "e91afd65095e098852aae7a73d47f3e02d6de304287cecded93c4feb0cc79de6", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そんなはずは……！\nも、もう、この話はおしまいにしましょ！", "zh": "诶！？怎、怎么可能……！\n好、好了，这个话题就到此为止吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a5694bdbfd83b47384ac7f8bd4ec775618a2dd8c7b26ad458dee562716b5ebe1", "ja": "ああ。でも本当に気付いてほしい時は、\n言葉でちゃんと伝えた方がいいと思うよ。", "zh": "啊。不过，真的希望对方注意到的时候，\n我觉得还是用语言好好传达比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "df28af77ab63742ad6efa573706f3b87984371de877ea19156ef4d64a2f657ab", "ja": "そ、そうね、そうするわ……はぁ。", "zh": "是、是啊，我也觉得应该这么做……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "63bcd257f1d38e09d1a7d2ff652c67dfda0e3ca2f0822d9e7a7dc671d9ab0e29", "ja": "けど、私はアイドルですもの！\nだから落ち込んでる場合じゃないのよ！", "zh": "不过，我可是偶像啊！\n所以可没时间消沉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "828305afd85693dd1ac32b0d35ddde476559ca21ab8a554a0c79224ec44eae77", "ja": "失恋して落ち込んでいる誰かがいたら、\n私たちの歌で励ましに行かなくちゃだもの！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "要是有谁因为失恋而消沉的话，\n我们就得用歌声去鼓励大家才行呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1020_p", "source_sha256": "25a77539145ad22b4360f9bd47a04e07aff2c106b3984cd40a5419166d96f569", "ja": "うん、そうだな。莉緒達の頑張る姿が、\nきっと誰かの力になると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。莉绪你们努力的身姿，\n一定能成为某些人的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "4783e13cc9109e0d2d13065348097224cf3f924e716d8ef31cfc822002ae57c4", "ja": "ええ！　そのためにも、まずは私たちが\n思いっきり楽しまなくっちゃ！", "zh": "没错！为此，我们首先也要尽情享受才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0243_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "32ed57f290a5e50004d9f450088942c6af7e8f2c6f382a85ab4a8dcafe063326", "ja": "今日も、全力でハジけていくわよ～！\nはーじーけーろーーーー！！！", "zh": "今天也要全力嗨起来哦～！\n嗨——起——来————！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
